# BUG-002: Inefficient Transport Recommendation

## Summary

The AI recommended flights even when train or road travel was a more practical option based on distance, travel time and user convenience.

---

## Category

Recommendation Quality

---

## Severity

Medium

---

## Environment

Application: AI Travel Planner

---

## Prompt

Generate the best travel itinerary between two nearby destinations.

---

## Expected Result

The planner should recommend the most suitable mode of transport after considering factors such as travel distance, duration, cost and convenience.

---

## Actual Result

The AI suggested flight options even though train or road travel would have been a more practical and efficient recommendation.

---

## Steps to Reproduce

1. Generate an itinerary between nearby cities.
2. Review the recommended transport mode.
3. Compare it with practical alternatives based on distance, travel time and availability.

---

## Impact

The itinerary may increase travel cost, planning effort and overall travel time.

---

## Recommendation

Incorporate distance, travel duration and route suitability into transport selection before recommending flights.
